      "writtenOn": "2014-05-21T15:36:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "White space folding for case ignore matching is defined in RFC 2252, not RFC 4518, right?",
      "revId": "4ee9093b0431e4dcdc40bcd5f65475722dac3a95",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7adec928_eb1c1d7a",
        "filename": "keystone/common/ldap/core.py",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 148,
      "author": {
        "id": 6486
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-05-21T19:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "RFC 2252 is obsolete according to http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2252\n\nRFC 4518 describes folding in http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4518#section-2.6.1",
      "parentUuid": "7adec928_e508cc93",
      "revId": "4ee9093b0431e4dcdc40bcd5f65475722dac3a95",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7adec928_c5ed9090",
        "filename": "keystone/common/ldap/core.py",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 151,
      "author": {
        "id": 8116
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-05-21T15:36:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "RFC 2252 says:\n\nWhen performing the caseIgnoreMatch, caseIgnoreListMatch,\ntelephoneNumberMatch, caseExactIA5Match and caseIgnoreIA5Match,\nmultiple adjoining whitespace characters are treated the same as an\nindividual space, and leading and trailing whitespace is ignored.\n\nSo wouldn\u0027t this be clearer if it were value.strip().lower() instead of  \u0027 \u0027 + value.lower() + \u0027 \u0027\n\nYour code has the correct semantic result but it seems to suggest there should be a leading and trailing space.",
      "revId": "4ee9093b0431e4dcdc40bcd5f65475722dac3a95",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7adec928_760f142f",
        "filename": "keystone/common/ldap/core.py",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 151,
      "author": {
        "id": 6486
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-05-21T19:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll implement it this way instead since it should wind up being the same. Plus I didn\u0027t even do it right since it says a single space should turn into 2 spaces.",
      "parentUuid": "7adec928_c5ed9090",
      "revId": "4ee9093b0431e4dcdc40bcd5f65475722dac3a95",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
